AM DPCV              L. P. SCHMID      CODE 822                    62           
AM DPCV    DOUBLE PRECISION CONVERSION FOR FORTRAN OUTPUT                       
AM DPCV    DECIMAL OUTPUT J3             FAP           SR7090                   
AM DPCV                                SW  2PA  0LS  8                          
AM DPCV    FAP SOURCE CARDS      220BCDCOLUMN BINARY CARDS    24BIN             
AM DPCV    *DOUBLE *PRECISION CONVERSION FOR FORTRAN FORMATTED *OUTPUT          
AM DPCV    AM DPCV IS A FAP SUBROUTINE WHICH CONVERTS A DOUBLE PRECISION        
AM DPCV    7090 NUMBER TO A FORM SUITABLE FOR A VARIETY OF FORTRAN FOR-         
AM DPCV    MATTED OUTPUTS.  DOUBLE PRECISION ADD, SUBTRACT, MULTIPLY,           
AM DPCV    AND DIVIDE ARE INCLUDED WITH THE SUBROUTINE AS SEPARATE              
AM DPCV    SUBROUTINES.                                                         
 PUNCH FAP                                                                      
